SUMMARY:Name That Tune (The Very Best of 7 Decades) (October 24th)  
DESCRIPTION:Try New Things in Toronto!\nHello everyone\,\n\nHow well do yo
 u know your music? Come join us for a fun day of Name That Tune as we trav
 el through seven decades of unforgettable songs!\nFrom old favourites and 
 classic hits to songs you may not have heard in years\, we’ll put our mu
 sical memories to the test while enjoying a relaxed day of laughs\, drinks
 \, food and good company.\n\n\\*Please note that we are at The Pheasant: A
  Firkin Pub at 1999 Avenue Road (roughly 6 blocks north of Lawrence and so
 uth of the 401). We are in the back dining area—come find us!\n\n\\*Join
 ed by my other groups too :)\n\nEvent details below:\n\nSincerely\,\n\nSte
 ve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host)\n──────────────\
 nEVENT DETAILS\n**Name That Tune – The Very Best of 7 Decades!**\nThink 
 you can recognize a song after hearing just a portion of it? We’ll be pl
 aying music from seven decades and seeing who can name those tunes!\n\\*Yo
 u will be in groups of 4 to 6 people (working as a team)\n• Music spanni
 ng seven decades\n• Classic hits and memorable favourites from different
  eras\n• A fun mix of genres and musical styles\n• Test your music kno
 wledge and memory\n• Play along individually or work together with other
 s\n• Meet new people and reconnect with familiar faces\n• Plenty of la
 ughs\, food\, drinks and friendly competition\n• No musical expertise re
 quired—just come out and have fun!\nWhether you know every song or can b
 arely remember the title\, this is about enjoying some great music\, shari
 ng memories and having a fun night with friends!\n────────
 ──────\nFRIENDLY REMINDERS\nEvent fee: $10 per person for rese
 rved seating and event organization.\nFood and drinks are purchased separa
 tely.\nPay the event fee in cash at the event or by e-transfer in advance 
 to:\n[steveflemming11@gmail.com](mailto:steveflemming11@gmail.com)\n\\*Gre
 at dinner menu and food specials provided\n\\*One beverage or appetizer mi
 nimum upon arrival to support the venue\n───────────
 ───\nPARKING AND TRANSPORTATION\n\\*Lots of street parking on Avenue
  Road and free residential parking\nThe Pheasant: A Firkin Pub:\n[https://
 www.firkinpubs.com/thepheasantandfirkin/](https://www.firkinpubs.com/theph
 easantandfirkin/)\n\\*15–20 minute walk from Yonge & Lawrence subway sta
 tion—or simply take the bus or an Uber from the station.
