SUMMARY:The Saturday Night Pre-Karaoke Dinner Party! 
DESCRIPTION:Try New Things in Toronto!\nGood day everyone\,\n\nJoin us for
  a fun and relaxed Saturday night of great food\, wonderful conversations 
 and always new connections! Come on your own or bring a friend and enjoy a
 n easy going autumn evening with new and old friends alike.\n\n\\*Joined b
 y my other social groups too\; so we can anticipate a fabulous turn out wi
 th lots of friendly peers to begin our weekend with!\n\n\\*Please note we 
 are at **The Pheasant: A Firkin Pub** at 1999 Avenue Road (roughly 6 block
 s north of Lawrence - south of the 401 **(we are in the back dining area o
 r on the patio\, depending on weather and numbers)**\n\n*\\*You can ask th
 e bartender if you like to show you to the group (simply ask for Steve's d
 inner party)*\n\n-You'll find it's a cozy\, relaxed and enjoyable atmosphe
 re!\n\n**-Free Parking found on residential side streets**\n\n(Event Detai
 ls Below)\n\nSincerely\,\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host )\n\nEvent Det
 ails:\n**🎉** **The Saturday Night Pre-Karaoke Dinner Party!**\n\nWe’r
 e getting together at The Pheasant on Avenue Road for our **Saturday Night
  Pre-Karaoke Dinner Party!**\nThis is a casual social evening where you ca
 n enjoy dinner and drinks while meeting new people in a comfortable and fr
 iendly atmosphere. Whether you're new to the group or one of our regulars\
 , you're very welcome to join us.\n\n• 🍽️ Enjoy dinner and drinks\n
 • 🍂 Relaxed autumn social atmosphere\n• 👋 Meet new people and ma
 ke new friends\n• 💬 Plenty of time to mix\, mingle and chat\n• 👫
  Singles\, couples and friends are all welcome\n• 😊 Come alone — ma
 ny of our members do!\n\nLooking forward to another enjoyable Saturday nig
 ht together!\nHosted by Steve Flemming (Soul City Social Club)\n\n**Event 
 Fee:** 10 dollars (Cash only at the door) (HST included)\nor by e transfer
 : **steveflemming11@gmail.com**\n\\*No extra charge for those attending Mu
 sic Bingo :)\n\\*No extra charge if you are staying for Karaoke as well :)
 \n\n**Friendly Reminders:**\n\n-Arrive any time between 6:30 pm and 7:30 p
 m (please ask for Steve when you arrive)\n\n\\*Great dinner menu and food 
 specials provided:\n\n**Parking and Transportation:**\n\\*Lots of street p
 arking on avenue and free residential parking\nhttps://www.firkinpubs.com/
 thepheasantandfirkin/\n\n(15-20 minute walk from Yonge & Lawrence subway s
 tation-or simply take bus or uber from the station)
