SUMMARY:The Hunter's Moon October Karaoke Bash! (October 24th) 
DESCRIPTION:Try New Things in Toronto!\nGood day everyone\,\n\nGet ready t
 o sing\, laugh and celebrate the season at **The Hunter's Moon October Kar
 aoke Bash!** Whether you’re a confident performer\, a casual singalong f
 an or someone who simply enjoys great company\, come join us for a lively 
 night of music\, drinks and friendly conversation.\n\n\\*Joined by my othe
 r social groups too\; so we can anticipate a fabulous turn out with lots o
 f friendly peers to enjoy karaoke with!\n\n\\*Please note we are at **The 
 Pheasant: A Firkin Pub** at 1999 Avenue Road (roughly 6 blocks north of La
 wrence - south of the 401 **(we are in the back dining area to find us)**\
 n\n*\\*You can also ask the wait staff or bartender if you like to show yo
 u to the group (simply ask for Steve's games event)*\n\n**-Free Parking fo
 und on residential side streets**\n\n(Event Details Below)\n\nSincerely\,\
 n\nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host )\n\nEvent Details:\n**The Hunter's Moo
 n October Karaoke Bash! (Saturday\, October 24th)**\n\n-October is here\, 
 and we’re celebrating with an howlin' evening of karaoke and new connect
 ions! Choose an old favourite\, try something unexpected or relax with a d
 rink while cheering on the singers.\nYou don’t need a perfect voice or a
 ny karaoke experience—This event is about having fun\, meeting friendly 
 people and enjoying the moment. Come alone\, bring a friend or invite a gr
 oup. We’ll help everyone feel welcome!\n**Evening highlights:**\n\n* Kar
 aoke favourites from every decade\n* A relaxed and supportive atmosphere\n
 * Cocktails\, beer\, soft drinks and food available for purchase\n* Opport
 unities to meet new people\n* Plenty of music\, laughter and autumn fun\n*
  Two mics for duets as well :)\n\nPlease be respectful of the venue\, perf
 ormers and fellow guests. Everyone is encouraged to participate\, but sing
 ing is always optional.\n**Hosted by Steve Flemming — Soul City Social C
 lub**\n\n***\n\n**Event Fee:** 10 dollars (Cash only at the door) (HST inc
 luded)\nor by e transfer: **steveflemming11@gmail.com**\n\n***\n\n**Friend
 ly Reminders:**\n\n-Arrive any time after 7:30 pm (in the back area- great
  for board games\, card games and mingling) (event goes to roughly 12:00 a
 m)\n\n\\*Great dinner menu and food specials provided:\n(Two beverage or b
 everage and an appetizer minimum to support the venue at this great event)
 \n\n**Parking and Transportation:**\n\\*Lots of street parking on avenue a
 nd free residential parking\nhttps://www.firkinpubs.com/thepheasantandfirk
 in/\n\n(15-20 minute walk from Yonge & Lawrence subway station-or simply t
 ake bus or uber from the station)
