SUMMARY:Music Bingo with Friends! (Best of 7 Decades!)
DESCRIPTION:Try New Things in Toronto!\nHello everyone\,\n\nI'd like to in
 vite you out to a fun-filled afternoon with this fantastic social game cal
 led **MUSIC BINGO with Friends! (Best of 7 Decades!)**\n\nEveryone can pla
 y (It's easy to learn and most of all it's a lot of fun!)\n\n\\*Joined by 
 my other social groups too\; so we can anticipate a fabulous turn out\n\n\
 \*Please note we are at **The Pheasant: A Firkin Pub** at 1999 Avenue Road
  (roughly 6 blocks north of Lawrence - south of the 401 **(we are in the b
 ack dining area to find us)**\n\n*\\*You can also ask the wait staff or ba
 rtender if you like to show you to the group (simply ask for Steve's games
  event)*\n\nEvent Details Below:\n\nSincerely\,\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Organi
 zer/Host)\n\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\
 \-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**Details of Event:**\n**Music Bingo 
 with Friends! (Best of 7 Decades!)**\n\nMusic Bingo puts a fun musical twi
 st on traditional bingo. Instead of listening for numbers\, you'll hear fa
 miliar songs from across the decades and mark them off on your Music Bingo
  card.\n\nYou don't need to be a music expert — recognizing the songs\, 
 singing along and enjoying the company is all part of the fun!\n\n• **Se
 ven decades of great music** with plenty of familiar favourites\n• **Tre
 ats for our winning participants** during the different rounds\n• **Meet
  and mingle** with a friendly group while enjoying a relaxed social atmosp
 here\n• **Come on your own or invite some friends** — we'll get everyo
 ne settled in and ready to play\n\n**Event Fee: $10**\nYour event fee incl
 udes **Music Bingo\, treats for our winners\, reserved seating and plenty 
 of music\, laughs and fun throughout the event.**\nPayment can be made **i
 n cash at the event** or **in advance by e-transfer to [SteveFlemming11@gm
 ail.com](mailto:SteveFlemming11@gmail.com)**.\nIf paying by e-transfer\, p
 lease include **your name** in the message so your payment can be easily i
 dentified.\n\nBring your music memories\, your sense of humour and maybe e
 ven your singing voice — although singing along is completely optional!\
 n\n**Friendly Reminders:**\n\nPlease arrive between **3:00 PM and 3:30 PM*
 * so you'll have time to get settled\, meet some people and get ready to p
 lay. **Music Bingo will begin shortly afterward.**\n\n\\*Great lunch menu 
 and food specials provided:\n(One beverage or appetizer minimum upon arriv
 al to support venue)\n\n**Parking and Transportation:**\n\\*Lots of street
  parking on avenue and free residential parking\n[https://www.firkinpubs.c
 om/thepheasantandfirkin/](https://www.firkinpubs.com/thepheasantandfirkin/
 )\n(15-20 minute walk from Yonge & Lawrence subway station-or simply take 
 bus or uber from the station)
