SUMMARY:The Sunday Night with Friends Dinner Party 
DESCRIPTION:Try New Things in Toronto!\nGood day everyone\,\n\nJoin us for
  **The Sunday Night with Friends Dinner Party**. A warm and welcoming even
 ing created for meeting new people\, enjoying good conversation and sharin
 g a relaxed meal together.\n\n\\*Joined by my other social groups too\; so
  we can anticipate a fabulous turn out with lots of friendly peers\n\n\\*P
 lease note we are at **The Pheasant: A Firkin Pub** at 1999 Avenue Road (r
 oughly 6 blocks north of Lawrence - south of the 401 **(we will be in the 
 back dining area)**\n\n*\\*You can ask the bartender if you like to show y
 ou to the group (simply ask for Steve's dinner party)*\n\n-You'll find it'
 s a cozy\, relaxed and enjoyable atmosphere!\n\n**-Free Parking found on r
 esidential side streets**\n\n(Event Details Below)\n\nSincerely\,\n\nSteve
  Flemming\n(Organizer/Host)\n\nEvent Details:\n**The Sunday Night with Fri
 ends Dinner Party**\n\nLooking for a fun and relaxed way to enjoy your Sun
 day evening?\n\n\\* 🍽️ Enjoy a delicious dinner in a relaxed\, friend
 ly setting.\n\\* 😊 Meet new people and reconnect with familiar faces.\n
 \\* 💬 Great conversation\, laughter\, and a welcoming social atmosphere
 .\n\n**Dinner Party Topics: (Optional)** may include but not limited too: 
 Travel\, Culture\, Spirituality\, Relationships\, Modern Dating\, Work/Lif
 e balance\, Life after Marriage\, Dating Apps\, Comedy\, History\, Art\, T
 echnology\, Economy\, Music\, Movies\, Sports\, Fashion\, Hobbies\, Books\
 , Psychology\, Philosophy\, the Future\, History\, Pop Culture\, Theatre\,
  etc.)\n\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**Event Fee:** 5 dollars (Cash only at the door
 ) (HST included)\nor by e transfer: **steveflemming11@gmail.com**\n\n***\n
 \n**Friendly Reminders:**\n\n-Arrive any time between 6:00 pm and 7:00 pm 
 (if you can) (please ask for Steve when you arrive-\n\\*Great dinner menu 
 and food specials provided:\n(One beverage or appetizer minimum upon arriv
 al to support venue)\n\n**Parking and Transportation:**\n\\*Lots of street
  parking on avenue and free residential parking\nhttps://www.firkinpubs.co
 m/thepheasantandfirkin/\n\n(15-20 minute walk from Yonge & Lawrence subway
  station-or simply take bus or uber from the station)
